    "body": "### Problem\n\nAfter searching within the current visual selection using `/\\%V`, `zqn` should place multicursors at each match. Right now no cursors are placed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* `nvim --clean`\n* Add this text:\n  ```\n  foo bar baz\n  bar baz foo\n  baz foo bar\n  ```\n* Type `vip<esc>/\\%Vfoo<cr>` to search for `foo` within the paragraph\n* Type `zqn` to place a cursor at each match – no cursors are placed.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nA cursor should be placed at each match.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1828+g7e1ae5115f\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nN/A\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nmacOS 26.6.2 \n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nghostty 1.3.1\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256color\n\n### Installation\n\nBuild from `main`",
